    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18908" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frŭtectōsus</span></b>  (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frutētosus</span></b> ), a,
		um, adj.
		frutectum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>full of bushes</i> or <i>shrubs</i>,
				<i>shrubby</i>, <i>bushy</i>, <i>bosky</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nemorosi frutectosique tractus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					2, 2, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">smilax spinosis frutectosa ramis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					16, 35, 63, § 153</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">16, 37, 71,
				§ 179</span></i>.</div>
